    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Subtypes of congenital adrenal hyperplasia (CAH) </span><span class=\"Ref-PMID\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{28576284; 33415088; 30719691; 33381483; 9521938; 30272171; 28541281; 7988480}</span></span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Lori A. Erickson",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 703.3pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Subtype of CAH</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gene</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clinical</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">21-hydroxylase deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CYP21A2</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Classic:</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Incidence 1:14&nbsp;000&ndash;18&nbsp;000; salt wasting; ambiguous genitalia in 46,XX; virilization</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Non-classic:</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Incidence 1:200; hypertension; virilization</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">11&beta;-hydroxylase deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CYP11B1</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Classic:</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Incidence 1:100&nbsp;000; hypertension; virilization; disorder of sex development in 46,XX</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Non-classic:</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Rare; possible hypertension; virilization</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">17&alpha;-hydroxylase/17,20-lyase deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CYP17A1</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Incidence 1:50&nbsp;000; hypertension; sexual infantilism and puberty failure with female external genitalia in both 46,XX and 46,XY</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">3&beta;-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">HSD3B2</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare; salt wasting; ambiguous genitalia in male patients; rarely virilization in 46,XX</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P450 oxidoreductase deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">POR</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare; hypertension; atypical genitalia in female and male patients; sex steroid deficiency; skeletal abnormalities similar to those in Antley&ndash;Bixler syndrome</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Congenital lipoid adrenal hyperplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">STAR</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare; most severe form of CAH; deficiency of all steroid hormones; salt wasting in classic type; female external genitalia in 46,XX and 46,XY infants; sex steroid deficiency; lipid droplets may accumulate in tissues</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P450 cholesterol side-chain cleavage enzyme deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CYP11A1</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 525.4pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"701\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare; salt wasting in classic type; female external genitalia in 46,XX and 46,XY infants; sex steroid deficiency</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
